{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>the looks</strong><br>Pixelated graphics combined with simple geometry and models inside a 3D space for a simple and nostalgic experience!<br><br><strong>gameplay</strong><br>You get to play as a test subject in the testing grounds of an evil AI whereby, using your shotgun's knockback, you traverse the facility in order to face this evil AI!<br>If you aren't able to get past a certain level, you can always use the level selector in the main menu so that you don't miss any gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>why was this made anyway?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a start to my long jurney on becoming a great game developer i made this game as a starting point, inspired by some of my favorite games i hope this to be the mark of my begining and an inspiration to others that anyone can make video game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871630?t=1767220721","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871630?t=1767220721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871630/f6343177e6b39e31bf039fecf51dfaf1efb6fe37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767220721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871630/f6343177e6b39e31bf039fecf51dfaf1efb6fe37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767220721","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>the looks</strong><br>Pixelated graphics combined with simple geometry and models inside a 3D space for a simple and nostalgic experience!<br><br><strong>gameplay</strong><br>You get to play as a test subject in the testing grounds of an evil AI whereby, using your shotgun's knockba